    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2020-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2020-12-31"></period-end>
     <target>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">Output 1: 
1. Coordinate with KRG Economic Reform Task Force to identify reform priorities and for the implementation of the activities. 
2. Conduct a high level discussion workshop for KRG officials to discuss priority Economic Reform initiatives and develop a workplan for 2020. 
3. Brief ER Task Force on the FFER-KRG activities progress on quarterly bases.

Output 2: 
1. Deploy the following Consultant to support KRG: Investment Policy SP, 2) Industry SP, 3) Pension SP, 4) Data Migration SP, 5) Senior MIS Officer, 6) Governorate MIS Officers, 7) Social Protection MIS SP, 8) Social Protection SP, 9) Entrepreneurship SP, 10)Tourism Sector SP.
2. Develop the following: 1) PPP Framework, 2) Electricity Sector Law, 3) Social Protection Framework, 4) Investment Reform Roadmap, 5) Industrial sector Development Roadmap, 6) KRG Vision 2030, 7) KRG Economic Reform Priority for 2020 and 8) Pension System Adopted
3. Support KRG with the implementation of the following reform actions. 1) Develop Social Protection MIS</narrative>
      </comment>
     </target>
     <actual>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">Output 1: 
1. The following TFs have been established. A) Economic Reform Priority Initiatives, B) PPP Framework and Pipeline. 
2. UNDP Economic Reform Specialist conducted a mission to KRG and met with KRG officials and developed KRG Current and Future Economic Reform Agenda. 
3. KRG ER Task Force meetings were on hold due to COVID 19. 

Out

Output 2: 
1. Three Consultants have been deployed: Investment Policy SP, 2) Industry Development SP, 3) Pension SP
2. The following reports have been completed and finalized: a) PPP Framework, b) Electricity Sector Law, c) Social Safety Net Regulatory Framework d) PPP Pipeline e) KRG Current and Future Economic Reform Agenda (KRG Economic Reform Priority for 2020).,f) Draft KRG Economic Reform Plan 2021 - 2023, g) draft Investment Reform Map, and h) KRG Industry sector Snapshot. 
3. Pension Management Information System is completed.</narrative>
      </comment>
     </actual>
